/**
 * Overflow content is clipped at the element's padding box, and overflow content can be scrolled
 * into view. Unlike `scroll`, user agents display scroll bars _only if_ the content is overflowing
 * and hide scroll bars by default. If content fits inside the element's padding box, it looks the
